{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54141","headline":"临行颂三首 三 · 利踪","name":"临行颂三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛性本来无阻障，衆生不识难归向。\n若见如来成佛时，莫向世间求取相。\n（以上五首均见宋渭颐藏主编《古尊宿语录》卷十二《衢州子湖山第一代神力禅师语录》）（按：《祖堂集》卷十八作「紫湖和尚」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"利踪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}